  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secretariat Tropical Forest Alliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secreatariat for the TFA, a private-public partnership that aims to remove deforestation from palm oil, beef, soy and pulp and paper.</narrative>
  </description>
